  "answer": "B",
  "numerical_answer": "",
  "tolerance": "",
  "solution": "$K_{rot} = \\dfrac{1}{2}\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}MR^2\\right)\\omega^2 = \\dfrac{1}{4}Mv^2$ and $K_{trans} = \\dfrac{1}{2}Mv^2$.\n$$\\frac{K_{rot}}{K_{total}} = \\frac{1/4}{3/4} = \\frac{1}{3}$$",
